    {
      "name": "@kadaliao/dsh-images",
      "title": {
        "en": "Images",
        "zh": "图片"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Ask for a picture and get one: a generate_image tool for the model, backed by your provider's image model, with the picture shown in the conversation and an Images panel collecting everything drawn as a gallery to browse, enlarge and download. A settings drawer picks the provider, key and model (searchable as you type); every picture shows what it cost, with the public LiteLLM price list covering models the provider does not price. Ask for a GIF and it draws a sprite sheet and assembles a looping animated GIF from it; pass reference images (attachments, files, earlier results) to edit or build on them.",
        "zh": "要一张图就给一张图：给模型一个 generate_image 工具，用你供应商的生图模型出图，图直接显示在对话里；「图片」面板把画过的都收成图库，可浏览、放大、下载。设置抽屉里选供应商、密钥和模型（输入即可模糊搜索），每张图都标出费用；供应商不给价的模型用公开的 LiteLLM 价目表兜底。要动图时让模型画一张精灵图，自动拼成循环播放的 GIF；也能带参考图（对话附件、文件、之前生成的图）改图或接着画。"
      },
      "icon": "./plugins/images/icon.svg",
